# Compliance Audit Guardrails
1. Every state mutation must immediately append to the `audit_events` ledger using deterministic cryptographic SHA-256 signatures.
2. Mask physical tape barcodes, drawer layouts, and hardware inventory from client-facing API response objects.
3. Cryptographic confirmation logs must utilize RSA-SHA256 signatures with public verification anchors.